**Zombies**: you can't live with them, and they can't live
without your brains. Slow and mindless, they make up for their
feeble offense with sheer numbers and a refusal to stay dead.

Attributes: Attack +1, Tough +2, Unique Ability +3 (Turns Defeated into Zombies); Clumsy −1, Dense −3, Slow −2, Vulnerability −2 (Fire), Vulnerability −2 (Head Shots).

